     * stability issues. * **Never** set a resolver nameserver to `127.0.0.1` on a cPanel & WHM server.
     *
     * Documented: Omitting nameserver3 retains the documented empty-string default. Explicit empty string is sent
     * unchanged. Incorrect resolvers cause performance/stability problems; never use 127.0.0.1 on a cPanel & WHM
     * server.
     *
     * API-map identity: whm1:setresolvers#GET (wire name setresolvers; Resolvers).
